WEBVTT

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.760
Breaker!

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:14.760
Takanori!

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:37.030
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:49.100
The New Legend

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:54.190
Takanori and Nozomi...

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:59.070
What's she doing?

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:03.580
Leave them alone. She played her part.

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:06.580
The seeds have already been sown.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:10.580
All right, Cerinthus! Let's finish this!

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.340
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:23.600
Don't move. If you're not careful, you'll get sucked in.

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.680
Threads of Blue Steel!

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:34.020
You, in the audience! Don't disturb the show!

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:40.110
Satsuki!

00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:45.540
I wonder how Asahi is going to react

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:48.210
when Haruto is sucked up and disappears.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:57.380
Asahi is the only one
who has the power to go to paradise.

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:00.180
Asahi...

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:04.010
You shall be worshiped for all eternity.

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:09.770
You shall shine brightly within the history of humankind
for tens of thousands of years!

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:15.110
-Shut up!
-I don't need you to understand. However...

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:19.900
Asahi is necessary for our paradise.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.320
Then all we have to do is stop you!

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.200
Let's finish this!

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:30.040
Catch this, Clive!

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:34.460
What?

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:37.920
Don't underestimate me!

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.590
Flames of Eternal Dominion!

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:03.360
We're done cleaning up here!

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:10.750
Cerinthus!

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.080
Haruto, stop.

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:17.920
Not deep enough!

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:23.220
Haruto, why won't you do what I tell you?

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.430
Haruto, to the right.

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:28.220
Satsuki, attack from above.

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:30.470
-Clive, support Haruto.
-What's wrong?

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:33.480
Nozomi, summon more familiars.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:36.310
-What's she saying?
-Takanori, attack their footing.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:37.480
Asahi!

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:42.990
-This is the start of the main event!
-Hey, Asahi!

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:46.740
Haruto... Haruto...

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.370
Hey, Asahi!

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:56.750
Asahi!

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:10.640
I hate you! I hate you! I don't need you, Haruto!

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:41.420
No. No... Why?

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.470
Wasn't it just a dream?

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:48.260
Why has Haruto fallen?

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:52.680
This is just a dream! This is just a dream! Then why?

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:56.480
Wake up! I didn't want this to happen!

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:58.900
I didn't see a future like this!

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:00.440
Calm down, Asahi!

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:04.820
This is bad.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:15.540
The time has finally come for the goddess to awaken.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:20.380
How can we break Asahi's spirit
and get her to truly awaken?

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.750
Nozomi did a good job.

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:31.050
-Cerinthus.
-Yes, ma'am!

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:37.560
Asahi!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.900
I remembered when Haruto and Asahi had a big fight.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:48.490
I thought if we could amplify the emotions
she felt at that time...

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:52.120
So, that's why you recreated
the Tower of the White Water Spirit.

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:54.080
It's true, at that time those two...

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:57.830
What's wrong?

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:01.330
Sorry. Sorry, Asahi.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:05.210
Once it's unleashed, no one can stop it.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:06.920
There's still time.

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:09.050
It's not over yet.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.640
We don't know when to give up.

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:14.140
Both me and Subaru.

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:28.360
You're fast when you're running away, Clive.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:34.780
-Clive!
-Don't worry about me, save Haruto!

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:38.330
The damage can only be healed naturally.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.920
What good am I as Queen of Elementals?

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:48.710
All I can do is delay the drop in his strength.

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:53.890
You can't run anymore!

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:57.060
Checkmate.

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:59.980
Give me your life!

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:02.560
I cannot do that.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.570
What?

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.280
You're late, Elicia.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:17.280
Well, well, Alterperiod. I never thought I'd see you.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:22.580
We got her too. Today must be our lucky day.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:27.710
The fourth and fifth members of Gnosis.
I'm not here to see you.

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:29.130
Acting tough.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:32.050
You're a bit late.

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.350
My Hexahedron!

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:03.210
What's going on?

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:05.790
Is anyone there?

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:09.420
Clive? Satsuki?

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:21.850
Asahi...

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:24.520
Are you crying?

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:28.310
No. Don't come near me.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:31.320
No. No!

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:36.200
Don't cry.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:39.910
MEMORY

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:57.130
It was still alive.

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:01.970
You said so, right? If I become stronger...

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:07.350
Then that's what I'll do.

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:09.980
So that I can protect you from anything.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:19.360
So that you don't have to cry anymore.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:33.460
I'll become stronger than ever for you.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:42.850
Finally...

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:52.770
Haruto, thank you for keeping your promise.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:57.530
I was able to come back because of you too.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:00.530
No way. Even Coeur de Lion?

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:03.700
We awakened him?

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.200
It looks like the tables have turned.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:09.620
Shouldn't we retreat for now?

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:15.340
No. If we go back without capturing Asahi,
I'd be too ashamed to see him.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:18.590
We weren't going to let you escape in the first place.

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:20.590
-Takanori!
-Nozomi!

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:25.350
I'll never forgive you for using me to hurt everyone!

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:28.100
Everyone's here.

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:35.270
You bastards.
Don't think it's game over that easily.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:39.820
We're going to make you tell us what's going on
when we capture you.

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.200
Don't move!

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:45.450
I'm going to make you pay
for playing around with Asahi's heart.

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:47.870
Alone? All of us?

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:52.120
Who do you think you are, Haruto?

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:11.390
Our linked sense, Utopia.
The bullets are going to fly around in there forever.

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:23.660
Asahi, your friends are all going
to disappear from this world.

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:25.410
Subaru will not lose.

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:32.410
We won't lose to anyone.

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:35.170
So there's no way Haruto will lose!

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:36.460
Cerinthus!

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:40.260
Yes, ma'am. Eternal Fire!

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:46.470
Bite, White Lion!

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:48.890
Leonidas...

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:51.270
Origin!

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:02.690
This isn't funny.

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:07.700
No. My paradise... My ideal future...

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:31.640
I was planning on making them talk.

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:34.810
Sorry, I couldn't hold back.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:39.650
But, I'm thankful that you brought Asahi
back to her senses.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:43.320
You too. You brought Nozomi back.

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:45.650
Everyone!

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:51.370
Sorry, I know that apologizing doesn't make it okay.

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:53.370
But, I...

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:00.040
-Asahi?
-This time, it's the real Nozomi.

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:02.840
I heard you were really pretty.

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:06.090
Are you the real Asahi?

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:10.260
I'm not a ghost. I have legs.

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:14.350
Asahi!

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.850
You're still a crybaby.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:21.400
I'm really glad you came back.

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:26.900
Satsuki, sorry. I said lots of mean things to you.

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:28.610
Yeah, you did.

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:34.200
Just kidding. I'm the one who's sorry
for causing the misunderstanding.

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.210
But I'm really glad...

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.880
-you came back...
-Satsuki!

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.970
You finally came to see us all.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:51.890
It's all meaningless unless the members of Subaru
gather together with their own strength.

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:57.680
I don't mean to be rude,
but there are a lot of things you need to tell us.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:03.730
No, Satsuki, we have to thank her first. She saved us.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:07.990
Oh, you're right. Thanks, Elicia.

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:11.530
You won because of your own strength.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:16.080
You saved me before somewhere, right?

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:18.870
So you were watching, I see.

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:22.920
Thank you for saving me.

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:27.920
You guys haven't changed. I'm glad.

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:32.430
We haven't changed? Elicia, are you...?

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:35.060
I just came to give you this.

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:41.020
That's Pleiades' sheath.

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:44.690
It was on the ground in the Lost Pentagon.
I picked it up.

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:49.990
That sheath. Nozomi, did you--?

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:53.530
Yes. I made it using the Dreamworld Sense.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.700
So this means everything is back at the beginning.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:04.960
By the way, if Subaru is a star system with six stars,
why did Pleiades have seven jewels?

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:09.380
Subaru was originally based
on the seven Pleiades sisters.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:12.720
That's why we gave it seven, right?

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:17.260
Subaru is a star cluster, not a star system.

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:22.230
It looked like six stars to some people,
and seven to others.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:25.940
That's why there are various legends about it
throughout the world.

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:27.940
Legends...

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:29.980
-Legends?
-And...

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:32.780
-What legends are there?
-...your real legend too.

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:34.450
There are theories...

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:37.120
What? What do you mean?

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:39.290
Elicia?

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:49.960
NET CAFÉ

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:02.600
Nozomi. Nozomi!

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:09.480
Are you okay?

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:16.280
-Why?
-I promised, right? I said I'd come get you.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:23.500
Takanori!

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:30.670
Don't worry, Nozomi. I'll explain to your parents.
I'll take responsibility.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:38.180
What I said "I'll take responsibility", I didn't mean--
What I meant was that I'll be responsible for explaining.

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:45.060
You know... Takanori...

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:49.270
Thank you.

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:53.740
Yeah.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:49.250
-LET'S ALL GET TOGETHER TOMORROW.
-OKAY. THANKS. TELL NOZOMI.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:51.290
All of us...

00:18:56.510 --> 00:19:01.390
Asahi, you really did bring Subaru back to life.

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:11.400
Brother, you're still awake?

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:17.400
-You're still awake too.
-I can't help it. I have a test tomorrow.

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:20.410
I see. Good luck.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:25.490
-You're different.
-Really?

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:28.290
Yeah, you look happier now.

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:36.000
It's because I'm with them. They're always so happy.

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:38.940
Good morning, everyone!

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:42.450
This will be our first action together
now that Subaru's back!

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:45.910
-So, what are we going to do?
-Good morning!

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:50.910
-I found an event that would be fun.
-We should rebuild our base first.

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:53.040
Leave it to me.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:59.170
-I'll make a new one that's much cuter than before.
-Let me help too!

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:02.840
-Let's make it really cute together.
-Yeah!

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:05.930
I'm worried.

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:11.220
-They're having fun. Isn't that great?
-We have to protect their happiness and smiles.

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:14.980
Yeah. That's why Subaru was brought back to life.

00:21:16.310 --> 00:21:17.480
We'll protect you.

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:21.650
No matter what. And surely...

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:39.090
Yesterday morning, an anti-government group
against the Special Preferential Treatment Law

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:43.090
for Persons in Possession of Senses
under the Senses Special Law was uncovered...

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:45.380
The ideal future, huh?

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:50.350
I know I'm not Haruto, but...

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:54.060
Don't underestimate a legend.

00:21:56.730 --> 00:21:58.940
This is our promise as Subaru.

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:00.650
We trust our friends.

00:22:00.940 --> 00:22:02.280
We hone our senses.

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:03.740
And we become stronger.

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:06.360
To shine brighter than anyone else.

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:10.240
In the name of our sworn bond. And...

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:13.290
Let's all become legends together!
